sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant MaaS as maas-controller
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant AGC as ai-gateway-controller<br/>SA: ai-gateway-controller
    participant Client as External Client / Browser
    participant GW as Gateway Envoy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS (openshift-ingress)
    participant Pre as payload-pre-processing<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant Auth as Kuadrant / Authorino
    participant EMP as payload-processing-external-model<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant Nemo as NeMo Guardrails<br/>8000 HTTP / 8443 HTTPS
    participant Prov as External LLM Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Proxy as maas-consumer-portal-auth-proxy<br/>4180/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OIDC as OIDC Issuer<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Portal as maas-portal Service<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over MaaS,AGC: Flow 1 - Tenant dataplane install (control plane)
    MaaS->>K8s: Write MaasTenantConfig/AITenant<br/>payload-processing-status=cleanup-complete<br/>SA token
    K8s-->>AGC: Watch event (HTTPS, SA token)
    AGC->>AGC: krusty render /config/manifests<br/>post-render + per-tenant rename
    AGC->>K8s: SSA Deployments, Services, ConfigMaps,<br/>EnvoyFilters, DestinationRules, NetworkPolicies,<br/>HPAs, ServiceMonitors, then CAS status=steady
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
    Note over Client,Prov: Flow 2 - ExternalModel inference (dataplane configured by controller)
    Client->>GW: POST inference request<br/>HTTPS TLS, MaaS API key / token
    GW->>Pre: ExtProc gRPC TLS (SAN-verified)<br/>extract body model → X-Gateway-Model-Name
    Pre-->>GW: Headers mutated
    GW->>Auth: wasm auth (gRPC, platform mTLS/TLS)<br/>MaaS credential
    Auth-->>GW: Allow
    GW->>EMP: ExtProc gRPC TLS<br/>intelligent_route + credential_inject
    opt AIGuardrail attached
        EMP->>Nemo: Guardrail check<br/>HTTP 8000 (no auth) or HTTPS 8443 (SA token)
        Nemo-->>EMP: Verdict
    end
    EMP-->>GW: Route + injected provider credential<br/>(caller credentials stripped)
    GW->>Prov: HTTPS 443, TLS SIMPLE, SNI=endpoint<br/>API key / SigV4 / OAuth2
    Prov-->>GW: Completion
    GW-->>Client: Response
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
    Note over Client,Portal: Flow 3 - Consumer portal OIDC login
    Client->>GW: GET /maas-portal/ HTTPS 443<br/>session cookie (none on first visit)
    GW->>Auth: AuthPolicy maas-consumer-portal-session
    Auth->>Proxy: /oauth2/auth HTTPS 4180 (service-ca)<br/>cookie forwarded
    Proxy-->>Auth: 401 (no session)
    GW-->>Client: 302 → /oauth2/start
    Client->>GW: /oauth2/start (anonymous AuthPolicy)
    GW->>Proxy: HTTPS re-encrypt :4180 (DestinationRule)
    Proxy->>OIDC: HTTPS 443 (system + odh-trusted-ca-bundle)<br/>OIDC client credentials
    OIDC-->>Proxy: Tokens → session cookie
    Client->>GW: GET /maas-portal/ with session
    GW->>Portal: HTTPS 8443 TLS SIMPLE via ReferenceGrant<br/>injected authorization, x-maas-identity
    Portal-->>Client: Portal UI
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 225)
    Note over Prom,AGC: Flow 4 - Metrics scrape
    Prom->>AGC: GET /metrics 8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Bearer SA token
    AGC->>K8s: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    K8s-->>AGC: Allowed
    AGC-->>Prom: Metrics
    end
